## The same app on pancake and Goblins

One Racket application runs unchanged on pancake's Racket binding and
[Spritely Goblins](https://spritely.institute/goblins/), timed head to head
across four small applications. The actors run in the Racket binding's vat;
this is not pancake's native Zig actor runtime or a concurrent-load test.
“pancake + time-travel” enables snapshot support but does not take snapshots.
The [benchmark methodology](https://github.com/jimisaacs/pancake/blob/main/bench/goblins/METHODOLOGY.md)
explains what is held constant.

```=html
