## Time-travel: snapshot and restore

This sweep varies actor count and bytes per actor. pancake and Goblins run on
different runtimes, so compare the shape of the curves, not their absolute
times. The benchmark supports the expected O(objects) behavior; source and
tests establish the sharing mechanism.

